  cat <<EOF
Usage:
  sudo $OPS_NAME                 Interactive menu (role-aware)
  sudo $OPS_NAME menu
  sudo $OPS_NAME list-menu       Print menu for current role (no prompts)
  sudo $OPS_NAME pull            Refresh scripts from CDN (pinned tag)
  sudo $OPS_NAME update          Pull scripts + update panels/tools
  sudo $OPS_NAME <command> ...

CDN / source:
  Default script base: $RAW_BASE
  Override: WG_RAW_BASE=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ahmadfarzad-amiri/wg@v1.0.11
